# Contributing

## Code Style for files which will be packaged into tarball

1. Use UPPER_CASE for macros, snake_case for others.
2. **Don't use `//` comments. ANSI C don't support them.**
3. **Don't use comments or spaces after macros, AT&T C preprocessor
cannot handle them.**
4. Use Microsoft C style using `clang-format`.
5. Don't create directory on this repository.
6. Don't use `#pragma once`, use include guards instead.

## Source file naming

Source files was named with a single alpha character and it's real name,
following 8.3 filename format.

### Meaning of the single alpha character

+ `b`: Built-in commands, e.g, `bcd.c` -> Built-in `cd` command.
+ `c`: cmd binary source files.
+ `g`: General source files, e.g., `glibcmd.h` -> General library for cmd.
+ `i`: Internationalization source files.
+ `l`: Library source files (libcmd).
+ `t`: Tools.
+ `o`: Overview files.
